#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/qgap.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: YES
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	432	NP_418598.1 adenylosuccinate synthetase [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	active site	W12,G13,D14,E15,G16,K17,G18,K19,N39,A40,G41,H42,T43,G128,T129,T130,A224,Q225,L229,V239,T240,V274,G275,G299,A300,T301,T302,R304,R306,K332,D334,V335,S415,T416,G417,P418	36	36	349762
1	Query_1	Specific	dimer interface	N71,A103,P105,R118,I127,G135,Y138,E139,D140,K141,V142,A143,R144,R145,G146,R148,S206,D207,D210,I231,D232,H233,G234,Y236,P237,V239,S241,G247,G248,A250,T251,G254,L255,R318,Q321,L322,N323,S324	38	38	349762
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
